        "created_at": "2019-12-02T00:24:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I haven't heard anything about it, but I imagine that actual generation of the PDF would be harder than the background code itself. The background code would be mostly generating random numbers, adding them, and referencing lists of values before asking for more user input.</p>\n<p>What language were you thinking of coding the program in?</p>",
